        "text": "[Description](#description) | [Examples](#examples) | [Usage](#usage) | [Arguments](#arguments) | [Select Options](#select-options) | [Common Options](#common-options)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 10,
        "text": "<a name=\"description\"></a>"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 12,
        "text": "## Description [↩](#nav)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 14,
        "text": "Select columns from CSV data efficiently."
      },
      {
        "source_line": 23,
        "text": "<a name=\"examples\"></a>"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 25,
        "text": "## Examples [↩](#nav)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 27,
        "text": "> Select the first and fourth columns"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 29,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 30,
        "text": "qsv select 1,4"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 31,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 33,
        "text": "> Select the first 4 columns (by index)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 35,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 36,
        "text": "qsv select 1-4"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 37,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 39,
        "text": "> Select the first 4 columns (by name)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 41,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 42,
        "text": "qsv select Header1-Header4"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 43,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 45,
        "text": "> Ignore the first 2 columns (by range)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 47,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 48,
        "text": "qsv select 3-"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 49,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 51,
        "text": "> Ignore the first 2 columns (by index)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 53,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 54,
        "text": "qsv select '!1-2'"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 55,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 57,
        "text": "> Select the third column named 'Foo':"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 59,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 60,
        "text": "qsv select 'Foo[2]'"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 61,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 63,
        "text": "> Select the first and last columns, _ is a special character for the last column:"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 65,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 66,
        "text": "qsv select 1,_"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 67,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 69,
        "text": "> Reverse the order of columns:"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 71,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 72,
        "text": "qsv select _-1"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 73,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 75,
        "text": "> select columns starting with 'a' (regex)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 77,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 78,
        "text": "qsv select /^a/"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 79,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 81,
        "text": "> select columns with a digit (regex)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 83,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 84,
        "text": "qsv select '/^.*\\d.*$/'"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 85,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 87,
        "text": "> remove SSN, account_no and password columns (regex)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 89,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 90,
        "text": "qsv select '!/SSN|account_no|password/'"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 91,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 93,
        "text": "> Sort the columns lexicographically (i.e. by their byte values)"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 95,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 96,
        "text": "qsv select 1- --sort"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 97,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 99,
        "text": "> Select some columns and then sort them"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 101,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 102,
        "text": "qsv select 1,4,5-7 --sort"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 103,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 105,
        "text": "> Randomly shuffle the columns:"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 107,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 108,
        "text": "qsv select 1- --random"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 109,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 111,
        "text": "> Randomly shuffle the columns with a seed"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 113,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 114,
        "text": "qsv select 1- --random --seed 42"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 115,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 117,
        "text": "> Select some columns and then shuffle them with a seed:"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 119,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 120,
        "text": "qsv select 1,4,5-7 --random --seed 42"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 121,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 123,
        "text": "> Re-order and duplicate columns arbitrarily using different types of selectors"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 125,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 126,
        "text": "qsv select 3-1,Header3-Header1,Header1,Foo[2],Header1"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 127,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 129,
        "text": "> Quote column names that conflict with selector syntax:"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 131,
        "text": "```console"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 132,
        "text": "qsv select '\\\"Date - Opening\\\",\\\"Date - Actual Closing\\\"'"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 133,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "source_line": 135,
        "text": "For more examples, see [tests](https://github.com/dathere/qsv/blob/master/tests/test_select.rs)."
      }
    ],
